          "en": "“Can we see what is in the chest?” you ask. “No,” says the spice seller. “It is not for sale. It is not mine.” He glances at the little yellow spirit, who is hovering over the lid. “It is not for him either.” Dādī smiles. “A good moment to learn how to say no.”",
